# The bundled app's overrides of policy/merge.env (docs/adr/0037 §5): the
# paths the platform cannot know. Read only by core/policy.py; KEY=VALUE,
# own-line comments, every key under its provenance. Renaming one of these
# paths silently changes risk scoring (docs/adr/0008 already warned about
# migrations).

# Provenance, decision: plan §7 M4 and docs/adr/0016 §2 -- a PR touching
# a migration is high risk and is not merged without review.
RISK_HIGH_MIGRATIONS=app/backend/migrations/*

# Provenance, decision: docs/adr/0016 §2 -- the app's one authentication
# module.
RISK_HIGH_AUTH=app/backend/meetups/auth.py

# Provenance, decision: declared by plan §7; no such file exists in this
# app today. The rule is proven by a synthetic test case (docs/adr/0016
# §3), not by app code.
RISK_HIGH_PAYMENTS=app/backend/meetups/payments*.py:app/backend/meetups/billing*.py
